<title>USA: Cerplex shrs moved off Nasdaq, now on OTC.</title>
<headline>Cerplex shrs moved off Nasdaq, now on OTC.</headline>
<dateline>TUSTIN, Calif 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cerplex Group Inc said Thursday that its shares have been moved from the NASDAQ National Market because its net tangible assets fell below NASDAQ's minimum requirements.</p>
<p>The company said its common stock is now traded on the OTC Bulletin Board.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
